<title>THAILAND: Thai Oct trade deficit widens to 36.2 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Oct trade deficit widens to 36.2 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday that Thailand's October trade deficit widened to XX.X 36.2 billion baht from a revised 25.0 billion in September and against 43.8 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE     Oct 96    Sept 96	 Oct 95</p>
<p>	  Exports	     116.4	112.5	  119.2</p>
<p>	  Imports	     152.6	137.5	  163.0</p>
<p>	  Trade balance     -36.2	-25.0	  -43.8</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok Newsroom (662)-252-9950</p>
</text>
